# Chart.yaml hygiene

- **`version`**: always full CalVer `YY.M.r` (e.g. `26.9.0`). Never omit `.r` in Chart.yaml.
- One-time migration from old **`YYYY.M.r`** (e.g. `2026.2.5` → `26.9.0`) is intentional; `ct lint` version-increment is disabled in `.github/ct-lint.yaml` until all charts use `YY.M.r`.
- **`artifacthub.io/changes`**: update whenever `version` bumps (required by releasenotes CI).
- **`artifacthub.io/signKey`**: always present (fingerprint + Pages pubkey URL). See SIGNING.md.
- **Rancher**: `catalog.cattle.io/display-name` and `catalog.cattle.io/os: linux`.
- **Library charts** (`type: library`): also set `catalog.cattle.io/hidden: "true"`.
- **`icon`**: prefer `https://retsamedoc.github.io/helm-charts/logos/<file>` with the file under `logos/`.
- **`name`**: must equal the directory name under `charts/`.

```yaml
# ✅
version: 26.9.0
annotations:
  catalog.cattle.io/display-name: My App
  catalog.cattle.io/os: linux
  artifacthub.io/signKey: |
    fingerprint: 40D16531ADC81528315B65664C77EFEB7F669F40
    url: https://retsamedoc.github.io/helm-charts/pgp-public-key.asc
  artifacthub.io/changes: |-
    - kind: changed
      description: |-
        Short releasenote for this version

# ❌ version: "26.9"   # missing .r — breaks SemVer-shaped tooling
```
